<title>CANADA: BioChem Pharma Inc Q4 profit rises.</title>
<headline>BioChem Pharma Inc Q4 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		   C$0.08</p>
<p> Net			 19,900		    3,500</p>
<p> Revs			65,000		   51,800</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    Profit	   C$0.63     Loss	C$0.10</p>
<p> Net    Profit	 C$33,400     Loss	 5,000</p>
<p> Revs		     223,600		  210,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Net results include company's share of the loss reported by North American Vaccine Inc, which amounts to C$4.1 million for 1996, compared to C$8.1 million for 1995. The share of the loss in 1996 is presented net of a gain on dilution, recorded in the fourth quarter of 1996 and amounting to C$5.5 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
